  title: LIght Intensity Dependance
  key: 5
  topic: 4
  boardContentText: The lighthouse light intensity depends on an external generator
  boardSprite: {fileID: 0}
  contentText: "Observation: when the auxiliary generator is engaged, beam intensity
    increases. The lantern therefore does not depend solely on the main power supply.\n\nWe
    recommend documenting all generator configurations.\n\n\u2014 Smith"
